=== Response ===
Minda Frostweaver is a character from the "Neverwinter Nights" role-playing game series, specifically appearing in the "Mask of the Betrayer" expansion pack for "Neverwinter Nights 2." She is an NPC (non-player character) and does not have a significant role in the main storyline but can be encountered during side quests or exploration.

In the game, Minda Frostweaver is described as a powerful and mysterious sorceress who resides in the city of Neverwinter. She is known for her mastery of ice and frost magic, which is reflected in her name, "Frostweaver."

